=\"88-df-provability-predicate\">88-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6bf67ec77619bc8d\" href=\"?note=6bf67ec77619bc8d\" title=\"88-df-second-incompleteness\">88-df-second-incompleteness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (formal theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\)</span> (metatheoretic consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" href=\"?note=b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" title=\"88-df-consistent\">88-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (inference-rule parameter for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_R\">\\(\\vdash_R\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr(v)\">\\(\\Pr(v)\\)</span> (standard provability formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"254200a991dbb642\" href=\"?note=254200a991dbb642\" title=\"88-df-provability-predicate\">88-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"6bf67ec77619bc8d\" href=\"?note=6bf67ec77619bc8d\" title=\"88-df-second-incompleteness\">88-df-second-incompleteness</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lob}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}})\">\\(\\mathrm{Lob}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}})\\)</span> (Löb property at contradiction)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}lob\\text{-}to\\text{-}second} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Lob}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\bigr)\n\\to\nT\\nvdash_R\\mathrm{ConSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}lob\\text{-}to\\text{-}second} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Lob}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}})\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\bigr)\n\\to\nT\\nvdash_R\\mathrm{ConSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>令 Löb 定理中的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\varphi=\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>；若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>证明对象语言一致性句，则 Löb 蕴含迫使<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_R\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(T\\vdash_R\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>，与元语言一致性矛盾。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"499d6d1436229742","anchor":"ref-1","targetAn